<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>happy endings do exist</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">happy endings do exist</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3f3UiKcmfzCkeV0QxOnBK9</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.252" end="00:22.902">뒤돌아보면</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.902" end="00:25.858">또 생각이나</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.858" end="00:33.858">What if I was more sure 'bout me, than you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.428" end="00:41.942">곁에있지만</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.942" end="00:49.942">No longer can I look at the way I did, anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.322" end="01:04.322">'Cause I been keeping it all of this to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.483" end="01:11.344">솔직히 난 너를 보면</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.344" end="01:15.308">마음이 아퍼</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.308" end="01:23.308">But if this is what you want, then I'll be alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.185" end="01:31.963">I'll watch from afar, so remember me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.963" end="01:39.963">I don't want no other one, but you (Ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.364" end="01:48.086">Happy endings do exist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.086" end="01:54.108">With you here, I'll still believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.108" end="02:02.108">No matter where you will be, I'll be here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.643" end="02:07.415">Hope you’re happier than this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.415" end="02:15.415">If you need, I'm right here by your side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.032" end="02:21.032">Ha, ha, ha</p></div></body></tt>